== Notes ==

* While ''polymorph self'' officially has an innate level of 4, each of the subspells that can be cast have an innate level of 3.  Crafting feats and [[use magic device]] checks will still use 4 for the innate level.
* Casting this spell interferes with additional spellcasting; see [[polymorph]] for details.
* No items merge into any form.
* In zombie form, a character is treated as [[undead]] in a few aspects. For example, ''[[harm]]'' and ''[[heal (spell)|heal]]'' have reversed effects, and the character can be [[turn undead|turned]] by clerics. However, the caster does not receive the typical undead immunities like immunity to [[critical hit]]s or [[sneak attack]]s.
* No form grants any [[Feat|feats]]. Notably, pixie form (unlike regular [[Pixie|pixies]] and [[Pixie (familiar)|pixie familiars]]) will not have [[weapon finesse]], unless the caster otherwise has it.

